 the io trooper currently  all alone and they will become the  fantastic four not not literally the  bromance will hopefully have a fourth  member by the end of the season and  these chaps could go on so many  adventures so please subscribe to stay  up to date with this pointless storyline  speaking of pointless stories we can't  get enough of let's check up on the rock  family last week they were sunbathing  and just vibing as the season title  tells us this time they're still doing  the exact same thing but mama rock is  throwing shade at cipher pk she's  finished reading his playbook and has  tossed it to the side in disrespect  sharon isn't a fan and has already moved  on to another book maybe that's what  she'll do all season read books and  stack them high dad on the other hand  hasn't moved a muscle he's trained the  dog to fetch more slurp juice can mutts  be trained to do this in real life  because i may need one the final member  of the family is continuing his  sandcastle building but it looks like  his ideas have grown and the starts of a  much bigger structure are in place kid  rock may be an architect in the making  he's changed a lot since the days he  used to fall off cliff edges  the slow rebuild of tilted towers  continues this week with a new building  taking shape the clock tower is now back  to its former glory and remember tilted  will be the home of player made  structures and act the same way the  block did i wonder if the chosen  buildings will suddenly appear overnight  or build slowly like this one the  constant evolution of tilted towers has  already begun  so as usual i went to visit the  rebuilding of another hero  truckersaurus and this week take a look  okay there's no change but it is now  possible for a truck to spawn here which  we know is the head of this transformer  but when is the big lad coming back it's  taking forever i'm not too great at  waiting oh hey remember at the event  when pili saved reality bringing a slurp  trailer to the mecca well in the story  we are told it's the one by sleepy  sounds yet in game right now it's back  again it's back in the water i know this  is because the entire continuity of the  story is not watched over with great  detail but it's a shame isn't it that  such a big moment for that character is  kind of undone elsewhere the rebuilding  of the island is almost complete we'll  be sent to destroy the last remains of  io later this week and the places the  missiles dropped are almost fully  repaired the rebuilt road below  sanctuary are now removing the burnt out  vehicles so this should be done next  update oh and a tiny tiny update you may  not know about is this guy lord vader is  here with a couple of stormtroopers too  at the start of each game you'll spot  his dropship choosing one of the many  star wars themed locations to drop it's  then your job to defeat him his blocking  is top draw so try to attack when he  throws his sword or another great time  is when he uses the force to lift an  object your hard work will result in  wielding his saber you could even  pretend to be him and trick other  players kinda like this video i made  that nobody watched self-promotion there  is one last thing this week an easter  egg from day one of the season which i  missed it turns out that at each of the  dj booths at the rave cave there is one  of these a cyborg crustacean has taken  up residency and a few people ask me why  they are half cyborg so here's a quick  recap on that weird story back in  chapter 2 the crustaceans built their  own community and each update saw them  progress through human evolution it was  really impressive to see a pirate-themed  village catching shark fish a viking one  too they even built the pyramids of  egypt before becoming a modern day  society sadly things went a little off  the rails as they made interstellar  testing and finally atomic bomb testing  and long story short they nuked  themselves the last time we saw them the  only way they could survive was through  technological upgrades they became  cyborgs it's been a few years since we  last saw them so that's why they're here  but i'm not sure why they both became  djs everybody wants to be famous these  days so yeah that's a quick recap of the  wobbly blobs so that's week three's  update how did i do did i miss anything  here's some legends who used my code in  the shop and sent me a twitter dm thanks  very much guys appreciate you right i'm  going to make a myth chaser episode and  find out what happens when someone  blocks with a lightsaber against a  ripsaw launcher it's going to be epic  see in a couple of days
 

